msgctxt "276"
msgid "Sorry, I lost him again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "It's okay. I've decided to trust him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Really, it's fine. Thanks to you, I came to realize I should\r\n"
"really put more faith in my husband. So you don't have to\r\n"
"worry anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Well... I'd better be going now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san... How'd it go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Actually... I ended up losing track of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"Oh, you did...? Well, I'm sure he'll be back at the mahjong\r\n"
"parlor again. It's only a matter of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"He'll go out for a short coffee break when he loses, then he\r\n"
"goes back in for more. That's always been his thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Got it. Then I'll go check out the mahjong parlor again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "My husband should be at the mahjong parlor around this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"You should be able to spot him immediately, since he's\r\n"
"usually covered head to toe in bright red sportswear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"What I want you to do is find out where my husband keeps\r\n"
"going after he's done gambling. Oh, and please be careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san... Did you change your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Sorry, but I think you'd be better off going to the cops\r\n"
"on this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"That may be... But, if at all possible, I was thinking you\r\n"
"could handle this without getting the police involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, you're the only one I can depend on. So all I can\r\n"
"do is wait here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "...All right. What is it you want me to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you! So, my husband should be hitting the mahjong\r\n"
"parlor at about this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"You should be able to spot him immediately, since he's\r\n"
"usually covered head to toe in bright red sportswear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "A man in red sportswear. Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"Now what I want you to do is find out where my husband keeps\r\n"
"going when he's done gambling. And when you figure it out,\r\n"
"would you please give me a call?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"So all you want to know is where he's been shuffling off to?\r\n"
"Okay, I think I can do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"Thank you. Truly. I don't know who else I can turn to at\r\n"
"this point..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"I hope he's not hiding something from me... But even if he\r\n"
"is... What can I possibly do...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Bartender. I'll have a drink, if you please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Very well, sir."
msgstr "Molto bene, signore."

msgctxt "732"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Here you are, sir. Please enjoy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "Um... Would you happen to be... Kiryu-san, by any chance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "That's me. Who's asking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid ""
"Sorry to come up and talk to you so suddenly, but... I'm\r\n"
"Ryoko Sato. I heard about you from my husband."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "Your husband?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"Yes... In the past, he used to work for... a particular\r\n"
"\"family.\" I'm sure you know what kind. Well, he was always\r\n"
"going on and on about this amazing guy from Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid ""
"He showed me your picture in a magazine once, and that's how\r\n"
"I recognized you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "I see... So what did you want from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"My husband he's... I think he's planning to murder someone!\r\n"
"Please, you've got to help him somehow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid "Slow down a minute. What makes you think he wants to do that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"Well... Back when he married me, he was able to wash his\r\n"
"hands of the business and work a normal job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid ""
"He started working part-time at a restaurant, and we've been\r\n"
"able to make ends meet with both of us bringing home a check."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"But... Late one night, I saw him... alone... with a knife...\r\n"
"sharpening it in the shadows... He must have thought no one\r\n"
"was watching..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid ""
"Not only that, but he's been making these secretive phone\r\n"
"calls to someone I don't know. I'm thinking maybe it's one\r\n"
"of his old associates, and that's who gave him the order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid ""
"Come to think of it, he's been doing a lot of strange things\r\n"
"lately..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid ""
"We've been eating out a lot more, he buys me clothes, he\r\n"
"keeps taking me on these trips... But we don't have that\r\n"
"kind of money. None of it added up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid ""
"And then, it dawned on me. My husband must be working\r\n"
"another job behind my back. That's the only explanation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"He promised me on our wedding day... that he'd never make\r\n"
"me cry again... But now he goes and does this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "Maybe he's been pulled into something against his will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"There's no way for me to know that... but if that really is\r\n"
"true, I'd do anything to get him out of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid ""
"Ohhh... How could he forget our wedding vows!? I thought he\r\n"
"was a changed man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid ""
"I'm begging you, Kiryu-san. Find out if my husband is up to\r\n"
"something vile, and if he is, put a stop to it! You're the\r\n"
"only one who can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr "Beh..."

msgctxt "1044"
msgid ""
"Sorry, but I think you'd be better off going to the cops\r\n"
"on this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid ""
"That may be... But, if at all possible, I was thinking you\r\n"
"could handle this without getting the police involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, you're the only one I can depend on. So all I can\r\n"
"do is wait here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid ""
"All right. I suppose I could be of some help. What exactly\r\n"
"is it that you want me to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you! So, my husband should be hitting the mahjong\r\n"
"parlor at about this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid ""
"You should be able to spot him immediately, since he's\r\n"
"usually covered head to toe in bright red sportswear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "A man in red sportswear. Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid ""
"Now what I want you to do is find out where my husband keeps\r\n"
"going when he's done gambling. And when you figure it out,\r\n"
"would you please give me a call?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid ""
"So all you want to know is where he's been shuffling off to?\r\n"
"Okay, I think I can do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid ""
"Thank you. Truly. I don't know who else I can turn to at\r\n"
"this point..."
msgstr ""

